  "benefits": "> **Financial Support:** \n\n\n\n  - **First year:** ₹30,000/- per hectare.  - **Second and third year:** ₹10,000/- per hectare (per year).\n\n> **Plant Distribution:** \n\n\n\n  - Supply of high-quality plants.\n\n\n<br>\n\n",
